<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντᾰχόθεν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from all quarters, from every
				side</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς Ἀσίης π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1007
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				190e
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιέχεσθαι π.</span>
			<i>on all sides</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.80
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>from every side</i>, i.e. <i>in every way</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἡ Ἑλλὰς κατείχετο μή</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καλῶς ὑπάρχον
			πολεμεῖν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				124
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.1.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. βάσκανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.242
				</span></i>
			.</div>
